<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak March ind output +1.5 pct yr/yr (+2.2 pct).</title>
<headline>Slovak March ind output +1.5 pct yr/yr (+2.2 pct).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output in March was 1.5 percent higher, year-on-year, after rising a real 2.2 percent annually in February, the statistical bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
